  reel_script and slides_spec state the farmers' meeting was held at the Tarapuram RDO office, which matches the article, but the caption says the complaint was raised at the meeting while the article says the mineral-soil sampling itself was done by unidentified persons without farmers' knowledge; the caption attributes the 'வியாழக்கிழமை' meeting date correctly but the reel_script omits that the Collector-level (RDO Felix Raja) response is only a promise, which is stated — no change needed there
