  reel_script and slides_spec say farmers asked 'மாவட்ட நிர்வாகம்' to clarify whether the information is true or a rumour, which matches the article; however the caption's 'மக்கள் கவனத்திற்கு' line asks the district administration to disclose the sampling details, which goes beyond what the article states as a farmers' demand
  reel_script includes the phrase 'அமராவதி ராஜவாய்க்காலில் புதர்களை அகற்றி முழுமையாகத் தூர்வார நடவடிக்கை வேண்டும்' — the article says the request is to remove grass and bushes in advance and fully desilt, matching, but the reel_script omits that the Amaravathi dam water level is rising, an important context fact for why the request was made
  the caption's 'நடவடிக்கை' line attributes to the RDO that he will 'உரிய விளக்கம் அளிப்பதாகத் தெரிவித்துள்ளார்', which matches the article, but the caption names RDO Felix Raja, a name that does not appear in the article as the speaker of that response
